		}
		{
			description: [
				"Thank you everyone for your support in the Terramity Discord server. I wouldn't have made it this far if it wasn't for your support, I really appreciate it :)"
				""
				"Credits to &5DM Dokuro,&r &4Machinae Supremacy,&r &6ENNWAY,&r &bPinPinNeon,&r &2RGRedsky,&r &9TheTrester,&r &1CDMusic,&r &3Gabey Garbs,&r &ctheforge129&r and &dHearts Plus Up&r for their amazing music that I've used in this modpack, I really appreciate it."
				""
				"&bCredits to Aurukel for the Voltaic Ingot sprite :)&r"
